      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I second this, especially after recent changes to User quick menu - now the buttons that I actually use often require scrolling (and I can't flick-scroll because of https://vrchat.canny.io/open-beta/p/1137-flick-scrolling-the-quick-menu-in-vr-can-result-in-selecting-users), whereas the default scroll positions has a bunch of buttons that I don't care about (yes, including the funny yellow button), or buttons that I don't need *quick* access to (opening the big menu is fine for those).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-01-14T18:41:35.042Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be very nice to have like a Customizable Menu where you can adjust, Relocate Buttons, Change menu Colors & Different Fonts. This would be a little refreshing.",
